    {
      "block_label": "text",
      "block_content": "With the rapid progress in the economy, it is natural that people's ideology is bound for change. Being  $ \\underline{26} $ is no longer a virtue to some people, and they are not alone in holding this view. Each might have different viewpoints on how to lead one's lifestyle: some prefer simplicity, some love luxuries, some spend  $ \\underline{27} $ , Some accumulate as much as they can like a country mouse. As I was born poor and in the countryside, the simple rural life seldom loses its  $ \\underline{28} $ to me, but as my station changes, I have an opportunity to  $ \\underline{29} $ with the newly rich, an experience which has revolutionized my view of lifestyle.",
      "block_bbox": [
